2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (DNA\040Fountain\040enables\040a\040robust\040and\040efficient\040storage\040architecture\056)
/Author (Yaniv\040Erlich\054\040Dina\040Zielinski)
/Subject (DNA\040is\040an\040attractive\040medium\040to\040store\040digital\040information\056\040Here\040we\040report\040a\040storage\040strategy\054\040called\040DNA\040Fountain\054\040that\040is\040highly\040robust\040and\040approaches\040the\040information\040capacity\040per\040nucleotide\056\040Using\040our\040approach\054\040we\040stored\040a\040full\040computer\040operating\040system\054\040movie\054\040and\040other\040files\040with\040a\040total\040of\0402\05614\040\327\040106\040bytes\040in\040DNA\040oligonucleotides\040and\040perfectly\040retrieved\040the\040information\040from\040a\040sequencing\040coverage\040equivalent\040to\040a\040single\040tile\040of\040Illumina\040sequencing\056\040We\040also\040tested\040a\040process\040that\040can\040allow\0402\05618\040\327\0401015\040retrievals\040using\040the\040original\040DNA\040sample\040and\040were\040able\040to\040perfectly\040decode\040the\040data\056\040Finally\054\040we\040explored\040the\040limit\040of\040our\040architecture\040in\040terms\040of\040bytes\040per\040molecule\040and\040obtained\040a\040perfect\040retrieval\040from\040a\040density\040of\040215\040petabytes\040per\040gram\040of\040DNA\054\040orders\040of\040magnitude\040higher\040than\040previous\040reports\056)
/Keywords (03\040Mar\0402017\054\040Science\054\040DNA\040digital\040data\040storage\054\040Columbia\040University)
>>
endobj
